{"1":{"w":[{"c":"وَالنَّازِعَاتِ","d":"wal-nāziʿāti","e":"By those who extract"},{"c":"غَرْقًا","d":"gharqan","e":"violently"}],"a":{"g":"By those [angels] who extract with violence"}},"2":{"w":[{"c":"وَالنَّاشِطَاتِ","d":"wal-nāshiṭāti","e":"And those who draw out"},{"c":"نَشْطًا","d":"nashṭan","e":"gently"}],"a":{"g":"And [by] those who remove with ease"}},"3":{"w":[{"c":"وَالسَّابِحَاتِ","d":"wal-sābiḥāti","e":"And those who glide"},{"c":"سَبْحًا","d":"sabḥan","e":"swimming"}],"a":{"g":"And [by] those who glide [as if] swimming"}},"4":{"w":[{"c":"فَالسَّابِقَاتِ","d":"fal-sābiqāti","e":"And those who race each other"},{"c":"سَبْقًا","d":"sabqan","e":"(in) a race"}],"a":{"g":"And those who race each other in a race"}},"5":{"w":[{"c":"فَالْمُدَبِّرَاتِ","d":"fal-mudabirāti","e":"And those who arrange"},{"c":"أَمْرًا","d":"amran","e":"(the) matter"}],"a":{"g":"And those who arrange [each] matter,"}},"6":{"w":[{"c":"يَوْمَ","d":"yawma","e":"(The) Day"},{"c":"تَرْجُفُ","d":"tarjufu","e":"will quake"},{"c":"الرَّاجِفَةُ","d":"l-rājifatu","e":"the quaking one"}],"a":{"g":"On the Day the blast [of the Horn] will convulse [creation],"}},"7":{"w":[{"c":"تَتْبَعُهَا","d":"tatbaʿuhā","e":"Follows it"},{"c":"الرَّادِفَةُ","d":"l-rādifatu","e":"the subsequent"}],"a":{"g":"There will follow it the subsequent [one]."}},"8":{"w":[{"c":"قُلُوبٌ","d":"qulūbun","e":"Hearts"},{"c":"يَوْمَئِذٍ","d":"yawma-idhin","e":"that Day"},{"c":"وَاجِفَةٌ","d":"wājifatun","e":"will palpitate"}],"a":{"g":"Hearts, that Day, will tremble,"}},"9":{"w":[{"c":"أَبْصَارُهَا","d":"abṣāruhā","e":"Their eyes"},{"c":"خَاشِعَةٌ","d":"khāshiʿatun","e":"humbled"}],"a":{"g":"Their eyes humbled."}},"10":{"w":[{"c":"يَقُولُونَ","d":"yaqūlūna","e":"They say"},{"c":"أَءِنَّا","d":"a-innā","e":"Will we"},{"c":"لَمَرْدُودُونَ","d":"lamardūdūna","e":"indeed be returned"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"to"},{"c":"الْحَافِرَةِ","d":"l-ḥāfirati","e":"the former state"}],"a":{"g":"They are [presently] saying, \"Will we indeed be returned to [our] former state [of life]?"}},"11":{"w":[{"c":"أَءِذَا","d":"a-idhā","e":"What! When"},{"c":"كُنَّا","d":"kunnā","e":"we are"},{"c":"عِظَامًا","d":"ʿiẓāman","e":"bones"},{"c":"نَخِرَةً","d":"nakhiratan","e":"decayed"}],"a":{"g":"Even if we should be decayed bones?"}},"12":{"w":[{"c":"قَالُوا","d":"qālū","e":"They say"},{"c":"تِلْكَ","d":"til'ka","e":"This"},{"c":"إِذًا","d":"idhan","e":"then"},{"c":"كَرَّةٌ","d":"karratun","e":"(would be) a return"},{"c":"خَاسِرَةٌ","d":"khāsiratun","e":"losing"}],"a":{"g":"They say, \"That, then, would be a losing return.\""}},"13":{"w":[{"c":"فَإِنَّمَا","d":"fa-innamā","e":"Then only"},{"c":"هِيَ","d":"hiya","e":"it"},{"c":"زَجْرَةٌ","d":"zajratun","e":"(will be) a shout"},{"c":"وَاحِدَةٌ","d":"wāḥidatun","e":"single"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, it will be but one shout,"}},"14":{"w":[{"c":"فَإِذَا","d":"fa-idhā","e":"And behold!"},{"c":"هُمْ","d":"hum","e":"They"},{"c":"بِالسَّاهِرَةِ","d":"bil-sāhirati","e":"(will be) awakened"}],"a":{"g":"And suddenly they will be [alert] upon the earth's surface."}},"15":{"w":[{"c":"هَلْ","d":"hal","e":"Has"},{"c":"أَتَىكَ","d":"atāka","e":"(there) come to you"},{"c":"حَدِيثُ","d":"ḥadīthu","e":"(the) story"},{"c":"مُوسَى","d":"mūsā","e":"(of) Musa"}],"a":{"g":"Has there reached you the story of Moses? -"}},"16":{"w":[{"c":"إِذْ","d":"idh","e":"When"},{"c":"نَادَاهُ","d":"nādāhu","e":"called him"},{"c":"رَبُّهُ","d":"rabbuhu","e":"his Lord"},{"c":"بِالْوَادِ","d":"bil-wādi","e":"in the valley"},{"c":"الْمُقَدَّسِ","d":"l-muqadasi","e":"the sacred"},{"c":"طُوًى","d":"ṭuwan","e":"(of) Tuwa"}],"a":{"g":"When his Lord called to him in the sacred valley of Tuwa,"}},"17":{"w":[{"c":"اذْهَبْ","d":"idh'hab","e":"Go"},{"c":"إِلَى","d":"ilā","e":"to"},{"c":"فِرْعَوْنَ","d":"fir'ʿawna","e":"Firaun"},{"c":"إِنَّهُ","d":"innahu","e":"Indeed he"},{"c":"طَغَى","d":"ṭaghā","e":"(has) transgressed"}],"a":{"g":"\"Go to Pharaoh. Indeed, he has transgressed."}},"18":{"w":[{"c":"فَقُلْ","d":"faqul","e":"And say"},{"c":"هَلْ","d":"hal","e":"Would"},{"c":"لَكَ","d":"laka","e":"[for] you"},{"c":"إِلَى","d":"ilā","e":"[until]"},{"c":"أَنْ","d":"an","e":"[that]"},{"c":"تَزَكَّى","d":"tazakkā","e":"purify yourself"}],"a":{"g":"And say to him, 'Would you [be willing to] purify yourself"}},"19":{"w":[{"c":"وَأَهْدِيَكَ","d":"wa-ahdiyaka","e":"And I will guide you"},{"c":"إِلَى","d":"ilā","e":"to"},{"c":"رَبِّكَ","d":"rabbika","e":"your Lord"},{"c":"فَتَخْشَى","d":"fatakhshā","e":"so you would fear"}],"a":{"g":"And let me guide you to your Lord so you would fear [Him]?'\""}},"20":{"w":[{"c":"فَأَرَاهُ","d":"fa-arāhu","e":"Then he showed him"},{"c":"الْءَايَةَ","d":"l-āyata","e":"the sign"},{"c":"الْكُبْرَى","d":"l-kub'rā","e":"the great"}],"a":{"g":"And he showed him the greatest sign,"}},"21":{"w":[{"c":"فَكَذَّبَ","d":"fakadhaba","e":"But he denied"},{"c":"وَعَصَى","d":"waʿaṣā","e":"and disobeyed"}],"a":{"g":"But Pharaoh denied and disobeyed."}},"22":{"w":[{"c":"ثُمَّ","d":"thumma","e":"Then"},{"c":"أَدْبَرَ","d":"adbara","e":"he turned his back"},{"c":"يَسْعَى","d":"yasʿā","e":"striving"}],"a":{"g":"Then he turned his back, striving."}},"23":{"w":[{"c":"فَحَشَرَ","d":"faḥashara","e":"And he gathered"},{"c":"فَنَادَى","d":"fanādā","e":"and called out"}],"a":{"g":"And he gathered [his people] and called out"}},"24":{"w":[{"c":"فَقَالَ","d":"faqāla","e":"Then he said"},{"c":"أَنَا","d":"anā","e":"I am"},{"c":"رَبُّكُمُ","d":"rabbukumu","e":"your Lord"},{"c":"الْأَعْلَى","d":"l-aʿlā","e":"the Most High"}],"a":{"g":"And said, \"I am your most exalted lord.\""}},"25":{"w":[{"c":"فَأَخَذَهُ","d":"fa-akhadhahu","e":"So seized him"},{"c":"اللَّهُ","d":"l-lahu","e":"Allah"},{"c":"نَكَالَ","d":"nakāla","e":"(with) an exemplary punishment"},{"c":"الْءَاخِرَةِ","d":"l-ākhirati","e":"(for) the last"},{"c":"وَالْأُولَى","d":"wal-ūlā","e":"and the first"}],"a":{"g":"So Allah seized him in exemplary punishment for the last and the first [transgression]."}},"26":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"ذَلِكَ","d":"dhālika","e":"that"},{"c":"لَعِبْرَةً","d":"laʿib'ratan","e":"surely (is) a lesson"},{"c":"لِمَنْ","d":"liman","e":"for whoever"},{"c":"يَخْشَى","d":"yakhshā","e":"fears"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed in that is a warning for whoever would fear [Allah]."}},"27":{"w":[{"c":"ءَأَنْتُمْ","d":"a-antum","e":"Are you"},{"c":"أَشَدُّ","d":"ashaddu","e":"a more difficult"},{"c":"خَلْقًا","d":"khalqan","e":"creation"},{"c":"أَمِ","d":"ami","e":"or"},{"c":"السَّمَاءُ","d":"l-samāu","e":"the heaven"},{"c":"بَنَاهَا","d":"banāhā","e":"He constructed it"}],"a":{"g":"Are you a more difficult creation or is the heaven? Allah constructed it."}},"28":{"w":[{"c":"رَفَعَ","d":"rafaʿa","e":"He raised"},{"c":"سَمْكَهَا","d":"samkahā","e":"its ceiling"},{"c":"فَسَوَّاهَا","d":"fasawwāhā","e":"and proportioned it"}],"a":{"g":"He raised its ceiling and proportioned it."}},"29":{"w":[{"c":"وَأَغْطَشَ","d":"wa-aghṭasha","e":"And He darkened"},{"c":"لَيْلَهَا","d":"laylahā","e":"its night"},{"c":"وَأَخْرَجَ","d":"wa-akhraja","e":"and brought out"},{"c":"ضُحَاهَا","d":"ḍuḥāhā","e":"its brightness"}],"a":{"g":"And He darkened its night and extracted its brightness."}},"30":{"w":[{"c":"وَالْأَرْضَ","d":"wal-arḍa","e":"And the earth"},{"c":"بَعْدَ","d":"baʿda","e":"after"},{"c":"ذَلِكَ","d":"dhālika","e":"that"},{"c":"دَحَاهَا","d":"daḥāhā","e":"He spread it"}],"a":{"g":"And after that He spread the earth."}},"31":{"w":[{"c":"أَخْرَجَ","d":"akhraja","e":"He brought forth"},{"c":"مِنْهَا","d":"min'hā","e":"from it"},{"c":"مَاءَهَا","d":"māahā","e":"its water"},{"c":"وَمَرْعَاهَا","d":"wamarʿāhā","e":"and its pasture"}],"a":{"g":"He extracted from it its water and its pasture,"}},"32":{"w":[{"c":"وَالْجِبَالَ","d":"wal-jibāla","e":"And the mountains"},{"c":"أَرْسَاهَا","d":"arsāhā","e":"He made them firm"}],"a":{"g":"And the mountains He set firmly"}},"33":{"w":[{"c":"مَتَاعًا","d":"matāʿan","e":"(As) a provision"},{"c":"لَكُمْ","d":"lakum","e":"for you"},{"c":"وَلِأَنْعَامِكُمْ","d":"wali-anʿāmikum","e":"and for your cattle"}],"a":{"g":"As provision for you and your grazing livestock."}},"34":{"w":[{"c":"فَإِذَا","d":"fa-idhā","e":"But when"},{"c":"جَاءَتِ","d":"jāati","e":"comes"},{"c":"الطَّامَّةُ","d":"l-ṭāmatu","e":"the Overwhelming Calamity"},{"c":"الْكُبْرَى","d":"l-kub'rā","e":"the great"}],"a":{"g":"But when there comes the greatest Overwhelming Calamity -"}},"35":{"w":[{"c":"يَوْمَ","d":"yawma","e":"(The) Day"},{"c":"يَتَذَكَّرُ","d":"yatadhakkaru","e":"will remember"},{"c":"الْإِنْسَانُ","d":"l-insānu","e":"man"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"what"},{"c":"سَعَى","d":"saʿā","e":"he strove (for)"}],"a":{"g":"The Day when man will remember that for which he strove,"}},"36":{"w":[{"c":"وَبُرِّزَتِ","d":"waburrizati","e":"And will be made manifest"},{"c":"الْجَحِيمُ","d":"l-jaḥīmu","e":"the Hell-Fire"},{"c":"لِمَنْ","d":"liman","e":"to (him) who"},{"c":"يَرَى","d":"yarā","e":"sees"}],"a":{"g":"And Hellfire will be exposed for [all] those who see -"}},"37":{"w":[{"c":"فَأَمَّا","d":"fa-ammā","e":"Then as for"},{"c":"مَنْ","d":"man","e":"(him) who"},{"c":"طَغَى","d":"ṭaghā","e":"transgressed"}],"a":{"g":"So as for he who transgressed"}},"38":{"w":[{"c":"وَءَاثَرَ","d":"waāthara","e":"And preferred"},{"c":"الْحَيَوةَ","d":"l-ḥayata","e":"the life"},{"c":"الدُّنْيَا","d":"l-dun'yā","e":"(of) the world"}],"a":{"g":"And preferred the life of the world,"}},"39":{"w":[{"c":"فَإِنَّ","d":"fa-inna","e":"Then indeed"},{"c":"الْجَحِيمَ","d":"l-jaḥīma","e":"the Hell-Fire"},{"c":"هِيَ","d":"hiya","e":"it"},{"c":"الْمَأْوَى","d":"l-mawā","e":"(is) the refuge"}],"a":{"g":"Then indeed, Hellfire will be [his] refuge."}},"40":{"w":[{"c":"وَأَمَّا","d":"wa-ammā","e":"But as for"},{"c":"مَنْ","d":"man","e":"(him) who"},{"c":"خَافَ","d":"khāfa","e":"feared"},{"c":"مَقَامَ","d":"maqāma","e":"standing"},{"c":"رَبِّهِ","d":"rabbihi","e":"(before) his Lord"},{"c":"وَنَهَى","d":"wanahā","e":"and restrained"},{"c":"النَّفْسَ","d":"l-nafsa","e":"his soul"},{"c":"عَنِ","d":"ʿani","e":"from"},{"c":"الْهَوَى","d":"l-hawā","e":"the vain desires"}],"a":{"g":"But as for he who feared the position of his Lord and prevented the soul from [unlawful] inclination,"}},"41":{"w":[{"c":"فَإِنَّ","d":"fa-inna","e":"Then indeed"},{"c":"الْجَنَّةَ","d":"l-janata","e":"Paradise"},{"c":"هِيَ","d":"hiya","e":"it (is)"},{"c":"الْمَأْوَى","d":"l-mawā","e":"the refuge"}],"a":{"g":"Then indeed, Paradise will be [his] refuge."}},"42":{"w":[{"c":"يَسْءَلُونَكَ","d":"yasalūnaka","e":"They ask you"},{"c":"عَنِ","d":"ʿani","e":"about"},{"c":"السَّاعَةِ","d":"l-sāʿati","e":"the Hour"},{"c":"أَيَّانَ","d":"ayyāna","e":"when"},{"c":"مُرْسَاهَا","d":"mur'sāhā","e":"(is) its arrival"}],"a":{"g":"They ask you, [O Muhammad], about the Hour: when is its arrival?"}},"43":{"w":[{"c":"فِيمَ","d":"fīma","e":"In what"},{"c":"أَنْتَ","d":"anta","e":"(are) you"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"[of]"},{"c":"ذِكْرَاهَا","d":"dhik'rāhā","e":"(to) mention it"}],"a":{"g":"In what [position] are you that you should mention it?"}},"44":{"w":[{"c":"إِلَى","d":"ilā","e":"To"},{"c":"رَبِّكَ","d":"rabbika","e":"your Lord"},{"c":"مُنْتَهَاهَا","d":"muntahāhā","e":"(is) its finality"}],"a":{"g":"To your Lord is its finality."}},"45":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّمَا","d":"innamā","e":"Only"},{"c":"أَنْتَ","d":"anta","e":"you"},{"c":"مُنْذِرُ","d":"mundhiru","e":"(are) a warner"},{"c":"مَنْ","d":"man","e":"(for him) who"},{"c":"يَخْشَاهَا","d":"yakhshāhā","e":"fears it"}],"a":{"g":"You are only a warner for those who fear it."}},"46":{"w":[{"c":"كَأَنَّهُمْ","d":"ka-annahum","e":"As though they"},{"c":"يَوْمَ","d":"yawma","e":"(the) Day"},{"c":"يَرَوْنَهَا","d":"yarawnahā","e":"they see it"},{"c":"لَمْ","d":"lam","e":"not"},{"c":"يَلْبَثُوا","d":"yalbathū","e":"they had remained"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"except"},{"c":"عَشِيَّةً","d":"ʿashiyyatan","e":"an evening"},{"c":"أَوْ","d":"aw","e":"or"},{"c":"ضُحَاهَا","d":"ḍuḥāhā","e":"a morning thereof"}],"a":{"g":"It will be, on the Day they see it, as though they had not remained [in the world] except for an afternoon or a morning thereof."}}}